ent-WFMobLaserRaptorFervidus = ashen laser raptor
    .desc = A raptor whose hide has gone the grey of the ashfields. It shoots anything that comes near.

ent-WFMobAshGolem = ash golem
    .desc = A lumbering figure of packed soot and coal. It is slow, but it hits hard.

ent-WFMobCinderSlime = cinder slime
    .desc = A slime the colour of a live coal. It glows, and whatever it touches catches fire.

ent-WFMobHellspawnFervidus = lava hellspawn
    .desc = Something that crawled out of the lava crust. Keep your distance.

ent-WFFireBlossomBloom = fire-blossom bloom
    .desc = A warm, glowing flower head. It is far too spicy to eat raw. Two of them with water and sugar make a fizzy drink.

ent-WFAshShroom = ash mushroom
    .desc = A grey mushroom from the ashfields. Eaten raw it will make you sick. Cook it in a soup first.

ent-WFCactusWaterPod = cool cactus pod
    .desc = A fat pad that is cold to the touch and full of clean water. Eat it to drink.

ent-WFFoodSoupAshcap = ash mushroom soup
    .desc = A thick grey soup. The poison cooked out of the ash mushrooms.

ent-WFDrinkBlossomFizz = blossom fizz can
    .desc = A fizzy energy drink brewed from fire-blossoms. It's warm and it kicks.

ent-WFEmberSpit = ember

ent-WFFloraFireBlossom = fire-blossom
    .desc = A flower that glows and gives off real heat. Walk into it and you will be burned, but the blooms can be picked from a step away.

ent-WFFloraAshCapShroom = ash cap
    .desc = A grey mushroom furred with soot. It can be picked, but eaten raw it is poison. Cook it.

ent-WFFloraAshLeafShroom = ash leaf
    .desc = A flat grey mushroom furred with soot. It can be picked, but eaten raw it is poison. Cook it.

ent-WFFloraCoolCactus = cool cactus
    .desc = A cactus that stays cold in the heat. Its pads are full of clean water and can be picked.

ent-WFFloraPlasmaSpitter = ember flower
    .desc = A glowing flower that spits burning embers at anything that comes near. Stay out of its reach, or stay out of sight.

ent-WFFloraAshLung = ash lung
    .desc = A grey puffball that breathes out a cloud of smoke when something walks past. Don't breathe it in.

wf-flora-fireblossom-singe = The fire-blossom singes you!
wf-flora-spitter-spit = The ember flower spits a burning ember at you!
wf-flora-ashlung-puff = The ash lung puffs out a cloud of smoke!

wf-recipe-ash-shroom-soup = ash mushroom soup recipe
wf-recipe-blossom-fizz = blossom fizz recipe
